{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10281020","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10281020","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:3:1028102001:0":{"text":"伊温小姐，真高兴见到你！你的声音有些虚弱，是魔力还没恢复吗？可腐化已经消失了……","source_cn":"伊温小姐，真高兴见到你！你的声音有些虚弱，是魔力还没恢...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x639E6C356ECFE746","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1028102002:0":{"text":"我……维持净化之雨透支了我的魔力……有些魔力随雨水散逸出去了。","source_cn":"我……维持净化之雨透支了我的魔力……有些魔力随雨水散逸...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3EE395C4DA43D71F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1028102003:0":{"text":"所以……我现在还没有完全恢复。","source_cn":"所以……我现在还没有完全恢复。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x42C0843F7164DAC2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1028102004:0":{"text":"把散逸掉的魔力找回来不就行了吗？","source_cn":"把散逸掉的魔力找回来不就行了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB5F5485247646424","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1028102005:1":{"text":"理论上是的。可是我散逸的魔力有些……特殊，很难用普通方法回收。","source_cn":"理论上是的。可是我散逸的魔力有些……特殊，很难用普通方...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0CA1B59B819BF83B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document